%% section: Deep dives
flowchart TB
    A["Millions of files"] --> B["Group by size — only equal sizes can match"]
    B --> C["Hash a small prefix of each candidate"]
    C --> D{"Prefixes differ?"}
    D -->|"Yes"| E["Not duplicates — stop, no full read"]
    D -->|"No"| F["Full content hash"]
    F --> G{"Hashes equal?"}
    G -->|"Yes"| H["Compare byte for byte before acting"]
    H --> I["Re-stat: the file may have changed since the walk"]
    I --> J["Only now is it safe to link or delete"]
    G -->|"No"| E
